.319Z"},"catagory":"Stir-fry Recipes","title":"Harissa Shrimp Scampi","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/stir-fry-recipes"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_627a83b591f142bd8cc5bd4f349b439f~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/4032_3024/20180225_185344.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/04/13/Bulgogi-Beef-Salad-Bowl","_id":"f71794ae-4cb1-4fe4-aafc-ba0f1e98bc0a","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-05-03T16:55:18.076Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-03T16:56:41.355Z"},"catagory":"Stir-fry Recipes","title":"Bulgogi Beef Salad Bowl","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/stir-fry-recipes"},{"photo":"image://v1/577c92_6fefbd775aaa47679fc420c93529613a~mv2_d_3154_2365_s_2.jpg/3154_2365/20180329_183854.jpg","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/04/25/Turkey-Ramen-Stir-fry","_id":"20a20682-7ea6-4ecb-adb4-a9222f1dd0e2","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2018-04-29T20:53:59.357Z"},"_updatedDate":{"$date":"2018-05-03T16:19:14.177Z"},"ingredients":"<p>Ingredients</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1 lb.&nbsp;Ground Turkey</p>\n\n<p>2 teaspoons peanut oil</p>\n\n<p>2 cakes of Dried Ramen Noodles cooked according to package directions</p>\n\n<p>1 inch knob finely minced&nbsp;Ginger</p>\n\n<p>3 large cloves minced Garlic</p>\n\n<p>2 cups shredded Cabbage</p>\n\n<p>1/2&nbsp; a White Onion</p>\n\n<p>1/2 cup Shredded Carrots</p>\n\n<p>1 can sliced Water Chestnuts sliced into large slivers</p>\n\n<p>1 small bag Bean Shoots</p>\n\n<p>1/2 of 1 small bag of Enoki Mushrooms</p>\n\n<p>2 large Green Onions sliced</p>\n\n<p>1 bunch Cilantro chopped</p>\n\n<p>1 small Serrano Chili diced</p>\n\n<p>1/4 cup fish sauce</p>\n\n<p>1 tablespoon sesame oil</p>\n\n<p>3 tablespoon soy sauce</p>","catagory":"Stir-fry Recipes","instructions":"<p>Cook the noodles according to package directions.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Mix together the fish sauce, sesame oil and soy sauce then&nbsp;set it aside.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Preheat a wok to medium high.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Add a few teaspoons of peanut oil&nbsp;to the very hot wok then half of the ginger and garlic. Brown the ground turkey then add the rest of the ginger and garlic.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Now add the&nbsp;cabbage,onion, carrots&nbsp;and water chestnuts. Stir-fry 2 minutes.</p>\n\n<p>Next, add the bean shoots and the green onion then stir-fry for 1 minute.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Stir in the cooked ramen noodles and top with the stir-fry sauce. Stir-fry&nbsp;for another few minutes to incorporate the sauce and heat the noodles through.</p>","title":"Turkey Ramen Stir-fry","link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/stir-fry-recipes"}],"dynamicUrl":"/Recipes/catagory/{catagory}","config":{"dataset":{"collection":"Recipes","pageSize":100.0,"filter":{"link-Recipes-catagory-catagory":"/Recipes/catagory/stir-fry-recipes"},"collectionName":"Recipes","sort":[{"catagory":"asc"},{"_createdDate":"desc"}],"seoV2":true}},"totalCount":17.0,"schemas":{"Recipes":{"displayName":"Recipes","plugins":{},"allowedOperations":["patch","isReferenced","insert","save","bulkInsert","bulkUpdate","update","truncate","remove","removeReference","count","bulkPatch","find","replaceReferences","bulkRemove","insertReference","get","bulkSave","queryReferenced","distinct","aggregate"],"id":"Recipes","fields":{"photo":{"displayName":"Photo","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"image","index":2.0},"url":{"displayName":"URL","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"url","index":1.0},"_id":{"displayName":"ID","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":7.0},"_owner":{"displayName":"Owner","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"text","index":8.0},"_createdDate":{"displayName":"Created Date","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"datetime","index":9.0},"_updatedDate":{"displayName":"Updated Date","sortable":true,"isDeleted":false,"type":"datetime","index":10.0},"i